Please find below a simplified view of the EFM fraud case creation process for transactions not alerted by the system:
1. Scope
Applies to fraud transactions not alerted by EFM
Includes both accepted and rejected transactions (based on conditions below)
2. Fraud Types
11 – Card Takeover
3 – Account Takeover
5 – Push Payment
3. Decision Logic
All transactions rejected → No marking, No case
All transactions unsecured → No marking, No case
Mixed scenario (at least one secured transaction) →
Mark all fraud transactions in EFM
Create case
4. Case Details (if created)
Mandator: Fraud Compliance
Case Class: Fraud CC
Case Score: 0
Comments: SAMA Case Serial Number
